{"parse": {"title": "5SP-06", "pageid": 8637, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/5SP-05\" title=\"5SP-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">5SP-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/6TH-01\" title=\"6TH-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">5SP</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.96.B0.E8.88.AA.E5.90.91\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"新航向\">新航向</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 新航向</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">New Direction</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-left: 16px; margin-bottom: -5px;\"><span class=\"item-link mode-middle mode-bonus\" data-itemid=\"2/2\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><div class=\"item-bonus-probability star-5\"><span>首通</span></div><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BA%AF%E9%9B%A8%E6%BB%B4\" title=\"纯雨滴\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BA%AF%E9%9B%A8%E6%BB%B4\" title=\"纯雨滴\"><img alt=\"纯雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/CurrencyItem-202.png/100px-CurrencyItem-202.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/CurrencyItem-202.png/150px-CurrencyItem-202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/CurrencyItem-202.png/200px-CurrencyItem-202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span><div class=\"item-middle-count\">60</div></span></span><span>&#8204;</span></span><span class=\"item-link mode-middle mode-bonus\" data-itemid=\"1/190010\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><div class=\"item-bonus-probability star-5\"><span>首通</span></div><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%B0%E9%A5%B6%E7%9A%84%E5%AD%90%E5%97%A3\" title=\"丰饶的子嗣\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%B0%E9%A5%B6%E7%9A%84%E5%AD%90%E5%97%A3\" title=\"丰饶的子嗣\"><img alt=\"丰饶的子嗣\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/Item-190010.png/100px-Item-190010.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/Item-190010.png/150px-Item-190010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/Item-190010.png/200px-Item-190010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span><div class=\"item-middle-count\">1</div></span></span><span>&#8204;</span></span></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>新<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>汽<span class=\"color-value\"></span>笛<span class=\"color-value\"></span>声<span class=\"color-value\"></span>又<span class=\"color-value\"></span>响<span class=\"color-value\"></span>起<span class=\"color-value\"></span>来<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>无<span class=\"color-value\"></span>论<span class=\"color-value\"></span>如<span class=\"color-value\"></span>何<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>登<span class=\"color-value\"></span>船<span class=\"color-value\"></span>吧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 31006</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>所有喧嚣的插曲都离开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这处阴冷的角落又恢复了寂静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员叹了一口气，开始收拾桌上杂乱的文件和沾灰的器械。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>是因为太过凌乱，才被误以为是杂物间的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>门口响起了清脆的脚步声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>意外事件。你竟然主动和人进行了交流。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>又是一个不征求意见便闯入房间的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……是她们非得闯进来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拉普拉斯的总负责人不置可否地耸了耸肩。她已在走廊上了解到了必要的信息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>如果你对此不满，可以在7天内提交跨部门行政申诉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>不了，那份文件本来就对我毫无价值。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>我扣下它，只是因为它是一本记录了诸多违规行为的非法报告。这种全是私人情绪的记录，有什么递交给我们严谨、务实、伟大的管理机构的必要？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>是这样吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>很高兴你对价值还有一些基于理性的判断。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>很高兴你还是一点都听不出反讽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>噢，所以刚刚这句是反讽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>无所谓了——你找我有什么事，露西女士？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员弯下腰，开始捡拾那些因无人关心而躺在地上许久的凌乱纸张。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是他最高规格的迎宾礼遇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>你专程来这样一个落灰的小地方，甚至没来得及带上那张假脸。<br />这应该不是为了什么发霉的陈年报告，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无脸的机器微微颔首，似乎在赞同这番话的合理性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>当然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我希望你来破译重塑之手的术式。你仍是我们最好的密码学家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……让一个人类的研究员，去破译一个纯血神秘学团体所用的术式？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>我看不出我对这个项目会有任何价值。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>有无价值不是你评估的，阿德勒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员头也不抬，只是继续把更多沾灰的文件摊在桌上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>是啊，你们评估，你们实验，你们穷举，你们试错。就像一台永不停歇的引擎，带着科算中心在这场混乱的雨幕中突进。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>无所谓道路是打结还是转圈，也无所谓时间是前进还是倒退，只需要知道自己在前进——朝改善现状前进。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>感谢你的称赞，这是我们所有人的荣耀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>我没有在称赞……算了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>——想必你也同意，没有创造力的生活是不值得一过的。而我已经彻底失去了这种能力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>我没有你们所需的那种将人类科技和神秘学结合的能力，我无法理解神秘学哪怕一星半点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>所以，我总归是没有用的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他将文件收拢，在桌面上叩出粗暴的声响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>我不指望你这块铁皮能理解人类心灵的结构——但至少让我清静一点吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机器并未理睬这番情绪化的发言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我们对重塑之手面具的解析并不顺利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>副作用正在科算中心蔓延，地下一层的隔离病房已经人满为患。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>真是不得了的症状啊，那你试过中止研究了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>没有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我们对面具进行了显影实验，在其中找到了与“暴雨”雨滴一致的成分。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>但解明它的成分，无助于推导它的原理。我们需要找到重塑之手使用的原始免疫术式。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>哈，这是当然了。你当然无法从一个人的体检报告推断出他的职业规划！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>而且，即使你们找到了原始术式，也缺乏验证的环境。它只会在“暴雨”到来的外界生效。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员的眼睛里闪烁着讥诮的智慧光芒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>所以，即便我们拥有了正确的术式，合乎规定的外出许可，还有意志高洁的志愿者，我们也无法得知自己是否取得了成果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>因为任何在象牙塔里的试验都是无用的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>——“暴雨”研究只能在“暴雨”里完成。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>很高兴看到你的头脑还算灵活，只用三句话就得出了我们这一周研讨会的全部成果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我想这足以证明你完全能胜任这项工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>总负责人将一份档案放到桌上。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_at_huofumandangan1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_at_huofumandangan1\"><img alt=\"1_4_at_huofumandangan1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Cg-1_4_at_huofumandangan1.png/600px-Cg-1_4_at_huofumandangan1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Cg-1_4_at_huofumandangan1.png/900px-Cg-1_4_at_huofumandangan1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Cg-1_4_at_huofumandangan1.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_at_huofumandangan1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>基金会已经派出调查员，前往这次历史维护小组预报的诸个临界点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>如果重塑之手仍打算像1929年一样人为加速“暴雨”，那么历史和社会的变革之处——时代的临界点，“暴雨”的中心处——很可能会再度出现他们的踪影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>这次外派的成员中，也包括你的姐姐，格蕾塔·霍夫曼。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……我对她的动向不感兴趣。我们的立场并不相同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>无妨。我只是想告诉你，阿德勒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>倘若有任何一人成功传回术式，免疫“暴雨”的研究就会立刻开始。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>你花多少时间来做心理建设都无妨。但“暴雨”预警一旦出现，我们只有24小时来验证。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>希望你那时已做好了准备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她迈着钢铁的脚步离开了，并未留下任何拒绝的空间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员将目光移向那份档案。最上方那张照片的面容还算熟悉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他拉开抽屉，从中拿出一张残页。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_at_huofumandangan2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_at_huofumandangan2\"><img alt=\"1_4_at_huofumandangan2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/Cg-1_4_at_huofumandangan2.png/600px-Cg-1_4_at_huofumandangan2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/Cg-1_4_at_huofumandangan2.png/900px-Cg-1_4_at_huofumandangan2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/Cg-1_4_at_huofumandangan2.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_at_huofumandangan2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是尚未交出的最后一份密码。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>如今，我可以笃信的是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>——人类的时代已经结束了。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "5SP-06"}}